Package: lagprotest
Title: Lagged Procrustean Randomization Test for Multivariate Time Series
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R:
    person("Diogo B.", "Provete", email = "dbprovete@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0097-0651"))
Description: Extends the Procrustean randomization test (PROTEST) to
    ordered multivariate series. Concordance between two configurations
    is scanned across candidate temporal lags. Significance is assessed
    with phase-randomized surrogates (default), cyclic shifts of the full
    series or free permutation of rows, and a global max-statistic p-value
    accounts for scanning several lags and selecting the best one. Returns
    the lag profile, the lag of maximal concordance and per-observation
    Procrustes residuals.
